    "detailed_description": "Speedrun Maker is a speedrunning game with guns.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMovement: <br />\r\nPlayers can surf, bunny hop, slide, and control themselves in the air.<br />\r\nGrapple Gun: physics based grapple that does not pull the player. Use it to swing off objects.<br />\r\nRocket launcher: Launch yourself to the finish.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLevel Editor:<br />\r\nCreate and upload your own levels easily with the built in level editor. Creating levels has been made easy with no 3rd party programs.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLeaderboard and Replays:<br />\r\nUpload your fastest times with replays, or watch the fastest times of other players.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOfficial levels:<br />\r\nPlay the included levels and fight for the most competitive records.",
